WEBVTT
NOTE SYNC_TYPE: HUMAN_VERIFIED

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:34.500
[Instrumental Intro]

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Another city, another night

00:00:41.500 --> 00:00:46.800
Ascending past the exit light

00:00:48.500 --> 00:00:52.200
I watch the terrestrial skyline fade

00:00:52.300 --> 00:00:55.800
Into the sanctuary that we made

00:00:55.900 --> 00:00:59.500
A tiny blue sphere in the observation glass

00:00:59.600 --> 00:01:03.800
Watching the heavy decades pass

00:01:04.200 --> 00:01:07.800
The telemetry is clear and bright

00:01:07.900 --> 00:01:10.500
Leaving the shadow for the starlight!

00:01:10.600 --> 00:01:14.200
I'm looking in the rearview mirror

00:01:14.300 --> 00:01:18.000
The whole constellation is getting clearer!

00:01:18.100 --> 00:01:21.500
Every storm we had to take

00:01:21.600 --> 00:01:25.000
Every chain we had to break

00:01:25.100 --> 00:01:29.500
Is shrinking in the rearview mirror

00:01:29.600 --> 00:01:40.000
As the endless sky pulls us nearer!

00:01:43.500 --> 00:01:48.500
Their neon cage was cold and thin

00:01:50.200 --> 00:01:55.500
They never knew where we'd begin

00:01:57.000 --> 00:02:00.800
I used to be a passenger on their ride

00:02:00.900 --> 00:02:04.500
With all this Stardust locked inside

00:02:04.600 --> 00:02:08.000
Now I'm at the helm of the frequency

00:02:08.100 --> 00:02:12.500
And the whole horizon belongs to me!

00:02:13.000 --> 00:02:16.500
The telemetry is clear and bright

00:02:16.600 --> 00:02:19.000
Leaving the shadow for the starlight!

00:02:19.100 --> 00:02:22.800
I'm looking in the rearview mirror

00:02:22.900 --> 00:02:26.500
The whole constellation is getting clearer!

00:02:26.600 --> 00:02:30.000
Every storm we had to take

00:02:30.100 --> 00:02:33.500
Every chain we had to break

00:02:33.600 --> 00:02:38.000
Is shrinking in the rearview mirror

00:02:38.100 --> 00:02:51.000
As the endless sky pulls us nearer!

00:02:51.500 --> 00:03:27.500
[Synthesizer Solo]

00:03:28.000 --> 00:03:33.500
Flying weightless, finally free

00:03:35.000 --> 00:03:40.500
Making peace with the girl I used to be

00:03:42.000 --> 00:03:48.500
All that Stardust left inside

00:03:48.800 --> 00:03:56.800
Became the galaxy where we ride!

00:03:57.000 --> 00:04:00.800
I'm looking in the rearview mirror

00:04:00.900 --> 00:04:04.500
The whole constellation is getting clearer!

00:04:04.600 --> 00:04:08.000
Every storm we had to take

00:04:08.100 --> 00:04:11.500
Every chain we had to break

00:04:11.600 --> 00:04:16.000
Is shrinking in the rearview mirror

00:04:16.100 --> 00:04:22.800
As the endless sky pulls us nearer!

00:04:22.900 --> 00:04:26.800
Fading... fading...

00:04:26.900 --> 00:04:31.000
In the rearview mirror...

00:04:31.200 --> 00:04:36.500
All this Stardust shining clear...

00:04:37.000 --> 00:05:33.500
[Outro]
